/* AVIS.ARTIFACT
   FILE: avis_cmt_artifacts.def
   NAME: AVIS_CMT_ARTIFACTS_DEF_LINK
   ROLE: Central linker for AVIS template definition files (.defs)

   PURPOSE:
       - Aggregates all AVIS .defs files into a unified reference point
       - Provides a single entry for AVIS template resolution
       - Establishes cross-linking between subsystem template definitions
       - Serves as the root DEFS index for AVIS template architecture

   LINKS:
       avis_cmt_artifacts.defs
       avis_c_artifacts.defs
       avis_h_artifacts.defs

   NOTES:
       - This file does not define templates itself.
       - It links DEFS files that define template structures.
       - All .artifact templates referenced by these DEFS files
         are wrapped by avis_cmt.artifacts.
*/
